  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-02",
  "title": "兵不接刃",
  "storyCode": "2-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3c90539a9a221995bf2d90d8c55ad8922bcb44b3ad9e4bfb81542287439d407c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "——以上就是此次战斗的全过程。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "你的评价？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "他们的实力确实合格了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "但魏长官，无论是在战略层面，还是关于他们的身份，我都认为......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......龙门近卫局完全可以胜任接下来的任务。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "对抗犯罪与侵略，近卫局绰绰有余。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "虽然罗德岛也能提供更多的可能性。但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "罗德岛所要求的“东西”里有一样，可不是目前罗德岛给出的条件可以交换的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "哪怕是仅仅在临时防卫上的合作，也完全无法与之等价。相比之下，罗德岛的“要价”有点太高了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "我想凯尔希小姐和阿米娅小姐很清楚吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "魏先生，仅仅防卫是不够的。整合运动还有很多你不知道的信息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "根据我们交战的情况推测，若不采取主动措施，整合运动将在未来数周内攻陷龙门。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......危言耸听。没有任何证据可以表明——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "陈警官，想知道切尔诺伯格一夜失陷的真正原因吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "请说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "阿米娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "啊......好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "罗德岛不仅亲历了切尔诺伯格事件，而且......我们经历了天灾，并且自灾难中活了下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "真是，真是，令人尊敬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "除了一些不要命的狂人，我还真没见到过多少人能从天灾中幸存呢。阿米娅小姐，请继续说，我在听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......我们与整合运动的领袖交过手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "嗯？她的名字是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "我记得不是那么清楚了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "塔露拉",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "哦，是的，塔露拉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "陈警官，你认为呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "————",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "我——知道。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......这就是罗德岛在切尔诺伯格的经历。遭受天灾的切城虽然脱离了乌萨斯的控制————",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "但是他们会需要扩张，此时仍然有大量物资缺口。而龙门是他们的下一个跳板。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "虽然龙门的确可以阻止一系列破坏行动，如果无法在未来主动出击的话，整合运动对龙门的攻击将持续不断——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "而且......最难以搞清楚的，其实是失去了切城的乌萨斯帝国他们对此事的态度......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "呵呵......小姑娘，你说的不错。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "出于局势紧张，以及龙门近卫局人手有限，我可以以之前的临时协议为基础，考虑一下你们的具体方案。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "但正如我刚才所说——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......罗德岛的要价太高，是吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "正是如此。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "为了弥补龙门的支出，我的条件啊，也很简单，只有两条。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "第一，罗德岛必须帮助近卫局解除整合运动对龙门的威胁。其中包括确认龙门内的威胁以及处理关于切城的相关问题。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "还有所谓的感染者的渗透状况什么的。总之无论有什么样的有利情报，我需要你们同步共享给龙门。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "——那，第二个要求是？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "第二个，要等你们完成了首要任务再说。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "当然，我的要求，不会超出罗德岛的能力范畴及业务内容。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我并不能理解。我希望魏先生详细解释一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "那就这么说吧。如果整合运动造成了超过罗德岛预期的损害——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "我希望罗德岛能够协助近卫局，妥善处理，甚至参与某些部分的善后。当然，也在你们的能力范围内。这是大致的内容。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "在这个点上，我尚不能细说。不过请不要忘了，罗德岛没有选择。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "如果不能接受，那么我觉得我们之前的所有说的条件，以及你们想要的都......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "阿米娅？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "凯尔希医生......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "魏先生，我希望将这一条也写入合约......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "“在诠释条例时，由双方共同参与讨论。”————这样可以吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "哦，哦......当然可以。这是对龙门的尊重呢，阿米娅小姐。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "陈警官，你有什么意见？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "——我认可这次行动。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "呵。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "看来陈警官也有了她自己的目标。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "那么——恭喜各位，龙门信任你们。陈警官将全权负责和你们的对接事宜。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "不过，感染者自由行动会引起市民的恐慌。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "希望你们在执行任务时，能服从龙门近卫局————",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "尤其是陈警司的命令。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
          "text": "龙门的关口将向罗德岛敞开，只要你们一切的行动都在正轨上。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "唔......啊......！那个大叔超难对付的......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "讲起话来慢条斯理，感觉他完全不为所动......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "阿米娅，你总得学会自己与他们交涉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "最后，你做的还不错。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "嘿嘿......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "说起来——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......你......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我认识你吗，凯尔希？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......你好，凯尔希医生。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "初次见面，Dr.凯尔希",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "............",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "凯尔希医生，请别为难博士——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "嘘——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......呵。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "希望我们之前的牺牲......能有所回报。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "你好，Dr.{@nickname}。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "欢迎回来。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
